  "brief": { "zh": "带两箱夜班零件到东边的出口。北侧的钥匙能开中门和东箱，西南角的开关能切断东侧激光。巡车每回合绕中央四格走一步，不能跟它抢同一格。每次开箱也用一回合。", "en": "Carry both night-shift parts crates to the eastern exit. The northern key fits the middle gate and east chest. The southwest switch cuts the eastern laser. A patrol circles the four middle squares, one step per turn. Stay clear of its square as it moves. Opening a chest takes a turn too." },
